flowchart LR
  INITIATIVE["Product initiative<br/>user or operator need and evidence"] --> OWNER["Requirements and acceptance criteria<br/>Identify product steward and repository"]
  OWNER -->|approved steward-owned repository exists| SOURCEISSUE["Typed product source Issue<br/>in the identified repository"]
  OWNER -->|no steward-owned repository confirmed| FACTORYISSUE["Record requirements, ownership discovery, and outcome<br/>in an Issue in an existing owning repository"]
  FACTORYISSUE --> FACTORYTRIAGE["Human prioritization in the approved portfolio Project<br/>planning context only"]
  FACTORYTRIAGE --> APPROVAL["Human decision on steward, access, repository, and bootstrap plan"]
  APPROVAL -->|approved existing repository| SOURCEISSUE
  APPROVAL -->|new repository approved| BOOTSTRAP["Authorized repository bootstrap<br/>Create or onboard from pinned Distribution and Primitive sources"]
  APPROVAL -->|unknown or rejected| HOLD["Hold without creating or mutating a repository"]
  BOOTSTRAP --> SOURCEISSUE
  SOURCEISSUE --> TRIAGE["Human prioritization in an approved Project<br/>planning context only"]
  TRIAGE --> AUTH["Source-Issue identity, permission, policy, and contract gates"]
  AUTH -->|pass| IMPLEMENT["Bounded feature implementation<br/>Actions and Codex in the origin repository"]
  AUTH -->|unknown or fail| ISSUEHOLD["Hold the Issue operation without mutation"]
  IMPLEMENT --> PR["Issue-linked pull request<br/>automated checks and independent review"]
  PR --> HUMAN["Human merge and release decision"]
  HUMAN --> EVAL["Product outcome evaluation<br/>observed behavior, users, and stated window"]
  EVAL --> NEXT["Reviewed result or unmet need"]
  NEXT --> SOURCEISSUE
  PROJECT["Project membership, priority, and progress<br/>do not authorize execution"]
  TRIAGE -.-> PROJECT
  FACTORYTRIAGE -.-> PROJECT
  GATE["Repository creation, access, stewardship, and bootstrap require explicit maintainer approval"]
  GATE -.-> APPROVAL
  STATUS["Current inventory: no distinct product repository, steward, or product outcome baseline identified"]
  STATUS -.-> OWNER
  STATUS -.-> EVAL
